  "notes": "Salim Ivomas Pratama (SIMP) — IDX-listed integrated palm oil + edible oils group, subsidiary of Indofood Agri Resources / Salim Group. ~215k planted ha across plantation segment (~530k acres total concessions) plus large downstream Edible Oils & Fats (EOF) refining + branded cooking oil business (Bimoli, Happy Salad Oil). Reports under PSAK 69 (biological assets at FV). Quarterly + FY filings via IDX. Values in IDR millions (matches seed-comps.json convention). Two-segment reporter: Plantation (upstream CPO/PK + sugar + rubber + tea) and EOF (downstream refining/branded). Plantation revenue ~40% of group total, EOF ~60% (downstream consolidates third-party CPO purchases). FV adjustment on biological assets disclosed in Plantation segment. Net debt Rp6-7T range across cycle, leverage moderate.",
